-:2i-MOTION
10. DR. TARIQ FAZAL CHAUDHARY, Minister for Parliamentary Affairs, to move under rule288 of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly, 2007 that therequirement of sub-rule (2) of rule L23 of the said rules be suspended in order to take intoconsideration the items No. 11to 20.TEGISTATIVE BUSINESS
11. SYED MOHSIN RAZA NAQVI, Minister for lnterior and Narcotics Control, to move thatthe Bill further to amend the Pakistan Citizenship Act, 1951 [The Pakistan Citizenship(Amendment) 9il,20251(Amendment in Section 5), as reported by the Standing Committee, betaken into consideration at once.12. SYED MOHSIN RAZA NAQVI, Minister for lnterior and Narcotics Control, to move thatthe Bill further to amend the Pakistan Citizenship Act, 1951 [The Pakistan Citizenship(Amendment) Bill, 20251, be passed.13. MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cabinet Secretariat, to move that the Bill to amend theCannabis Control and Regulatory Authority Act, 2024 [The Cannabis Control and RegulatoryAuthority (Amendment) Bnl, 2026), as reported by the Standing Committee, be taken intoconsideration at once.14. MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cabinet Secretariat, to move that the Bill to amend theCannabis Control and Regulatory Authority Act, 2024 [The Cannabis Control and RegulatoryAuthority (Amendment) Bill,2026), be passed.15. MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cabinet Secretariat, to move that the Bill further to amendthe Pakistan Names and Emblems (Prevention of Unauthorized Use) Act, 1957 [The PakistanNames and Emblems (Prevention of Unauthorized Use) (Amendment) Bill, 20261, as reported bythe Standing Committee, be taken into consideration at once.16. MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cabinet Secretariat, to move that the Bill further to amendthe Pakistan Names and Emblems (Prevention of Unauthorized Use) Act, 1957 [The PakistanNames and Emblems (Prevention of Unauthorized Use) (Amendment) Bill, 20261, be passed.t7. MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cabinet Secretariat, to move that the Bill to amend theNational Archives Act, 1993 [The National Archives (Amendment) Bnl, 2026), as reported by theStanding Committee, be taken into consideration at once.18. MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cabinet Secretariat, to move that the Bill to amend theNational Archives Act, 1993 [The National Archives (Amendment) 9il,20261, be passed.19, MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cabinet Secretariat, to move that the Bill to amend theNaya Pakistan Housing and Development Authority Act,2020 [The Naya Pakistan Housing andDevelopment Authority (Amendment) 8il1,20261, as reported by the Standing Committee, betaken into consideration at once.20. MINISTER-IN-CHARGE of the Cablnet Secretariat, to move that the Bill to amend theNaya Pakistan Housing and Development Authorlty Act,2020 [The Naya Pakistan Housing andDevelopment Authority (Amendment) Bill, 20261, be passed.21. SENATOR AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Law and Justice and Human Rights, tomove that the Bill to amend the lslamabad Capital Territory Senior Citizens Act,2021 [Thelslamabad Capital Territory Senior Citizens (Amendment) Bill, 2025), as reported by theStanding Committee, be taken into consideration at once.
[Amendments entered in a separate list to be moved]

